    per turn: You can activate this effect; for the rest of this turn, this card
    can attack all monsters your opponent controls, once each, also detach any number
    of materials from this card, and if you do, it gains 1000 ATK for each card type
    (Monster, Spell, or Trap) detached, and if it does, any monsters your opponent
    currently controls lose that much ATK.'
